    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "the job loss thing makes sense. but are there actually any real economists who think the \"green jobs\" argument is anything more than just a talking point? i'm seeing a lot of data suggesting those new roles don't actually replace the high-paying union jobs being lost in coal or gas.",
